# M19: docs/* (not docs/) so the negations below can still re-include
# tracked files -- a trailing-slash directory ignore prevents git from
# ever evaluating per-file negations inside it.
# M21-WU05/WU09: extended with the coverage baseline and maintainer
# recovery runbook -- each new tracked docs/ file must be added here
# explicitly, per docs/engineering/versioning.md's relevant-paths
# discipline.
# Lean Governance v0.2: extended with the docs/engineering/ directory,
# which holds the shared milestone-protocol/owner-map/prompt-template
# governance documents referenced by future milestone specs.
# Post-M34 reorganization: docs/versioning.md, docs/coverage-baseline.md,
# and docs/maintainer-recovery.md moved into docs/engineering/ (already
# covered by the docs/engineering/ negation below); the M31-M34 milestone
# build specifications and their closure/Work-Unit reports moved the other
# direction, from docs/engineering/ into docs/ -- each is now individually
# re-included here so this repository's milestone-history record stays
# tracked at its new location instead of silently falling under the
# blanket docs/* ignore.
docs/*
!docs/engineering/
!docs/AIQT_M34_WU34-01_Claude_Code_Prompt.md
!docs/AIQT_Milestone_31_Build_Specification.md
